{"ticker":"ICE","updated":"2026-11-27T23:00:07Z","profile":{"longName":"Intercontinental Exchange, Inc.","shortName":"Intercontinental Exchange Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ice.com","fullTimeEmployees":12842,"marketCap":99750641664,"trailingPE":24.317438,"forwardPE":19.957645,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.141371,"pegRatio":3.75,"targetMeanPrice":193.53333,"targetHighPrice":245.0,"targetLowPrice":167.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.147,"earningsGrowth":0.176,"grossMargins":1.0,"operatingMargins":0.53235,"profitMargins":0.38141,"totalRevenue":10912000000,"beta":0.844,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":181.38,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":121.79,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.17},"summary":"Intercontinental Exchange, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides technology and data to financial institutions, corporations, and government entities in the United States, the United Kingdom, the European Union, Canada, Asia Pacific, and the Middle East. It operates through three segments: Exchanges, Fixed Income and Data Services, and Mortgage Technology. The Exchanges segment operates regulated marketplace technology for the listing, trading, and clearing of an array of derivatives contracts and financial securities, such as commodities, interest rates, foreign exchange and equities, and corporate and exchange-traded funds, as well as data and connectivity services related to its exchanges and clearing houses. The Fixed Income and Data Services segment provides fixed income pricing, reference data, indices, analytics, and execution services, as well as global CDS clearing and multi-asset class data delivery technology. The Mortgage Technology segment offers a technology platform that provides customers comprehensive and digital workflow tools to address inefficiencies and mitigate risks that exist in the U.S. residential mortgage market life cycle from application through closing, servicing, and the secondary market. The company was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"InterContinental Exchange, Inc. 及其子公司為美國、英國、歐盟、加拿大、亞太地區和中東的金融機構、企業和政府實體提供技術和資料。它透過三個部門運作：交易所、固定收益和數據服務以及抵押技術。交易所部門經營受監管的市場技術，用於一系列衍生性商品合約和金融證券（例如商品、利率、外匯和股票、企業和交易所交易基金）的上市、交易和清算，以及與其交易所和清算所相關的數據和連接服務。固定收益和數據服務部門提供固定收益定價、參考資料、指數、分析和執行服務，以及全球 CDS 清算和多資產類數據交付技術。抵押貸款技術部門提供一個技術平台，為客戶提供全面的數位工作流程工具，以解決美國住宅抵押貸款市場生命週期中從申請到交割、服務和二級市場的低效率問題並減輕風險。該公司成立於2000年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":168.25,"h":168.84,"l":166.83,"c":167.99,"v":2661000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":167.89,"h":169.2,"l":167.55,"c":168.48,"v":2801300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":167.21,"h":167.21,"l":162.32,"c":162.64,"v":4121600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":162.05,"h":162.5,"l":160.7,"c":160.98,"v":3335900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":160.74,"h":162.95,"l":160.25,"c":162.62,"v":2910800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":162.07,"h":162.67,"l":158.23,"c":159.06,"v":3908100},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":161.47,"h":162.83,"l":159.17,"c":161.98,"v":5758300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":162.69,"h":162.69,"l":156.44,"c":159.37,"v":5054400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":160.96,"h":160.96,"l":158.26,"c":159.3,"v":3838700},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":159.62,"h":159.75,"l":157.43,"c":157.5,"v":4175400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":157.46,"h":159.34,"l":157.34,"c":158.75,"v":3074300},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":159.17,"h":160.5,"l":157.93,"c":158.27,"v":2849100},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":158.19,"h":158.84,"l":155.9,"c":157.46,"v":4174200},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":157.52,"h":157.52,"l":153.12,"c":153.36,"v":5576400},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":153.77,"h":154.02,"l":152.73,"c":153.6,"v":4090300},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":153.95,"h":155.42,"l":153.26,"c":155.29,"v":2884400},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":155.07,"h":157.36,"l":155.01,"c":156.79,"v":3560000},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":156.48,"h":157.4,"l":155.55,"c":156.95,"v":4676300},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":158.0,"h":158.44,"l"